The apartment boasts a futuristic marvel, an entire wall transformed into an interactive digital canvas. Gleaming with advanced technology, the "monitor wall" seamlessly blends into the décor, defying conventional expectations. Its surface mimics the smooth texture of the surrounding walls, concealing its true nature until activated.

[[goal: get rich on | id: rich | subject: DURAND | object: the show]]

!DURAND FENWICK (mid-20s), an exceptionally handsome and charismatic man, sits on the couch, playing a video game. His chiseled features and magnetic presence draw immediate attention, leaving no doubt about his captivating allure. A hint of vulnerability lurks beneath his confident façade, adding depth to his enigmatic persona.

INSERT

Closeup on the a camera looking down on Durand.

!BACK TO SCENE

On the wall, a "window" opens showing outside of the door.

!BARRY (mid-20s), a member of the Population Control Bureau (PCB), stands outside the door, dressed in military-like garb adorned with a PCB patch. He carries an air of authority, though not as striking as Durand. His demeanor is serious and focused, a testament to his dedication to his work.

                COMPUTER (V.O)
    Barry is here. One registered weapon found. Identified as a resident, admitting.

[[beat: Barry brings news that Durand will be a contestant | id: b20 | ahead: BARRY]]

!BARRY comes into the Room. The wall "window" disappears.

                BARRY
        (smirking)
    Dude! Did you get it?

!Durand nods, stands up and pulls out the ring out of his pocket. He opens it.

insert ring opening up

!Durand looks up.

                DURAND
        (reserved)
    What do you think?

                BARRY
    Bro, while I was walking the halls at the studio, and get this. Archibald Duke actually said YOUR NAME!

                DURAND
        (raising eyebrows)
    Wait? What? The Archibald Duke? How do you know it was me?

                BARRY
        (sarcastic)
    How many Durand Fenwick are there? You're going to be a contestant, dude!

                DURAND
        (mockingly)
    On Moral Dilemma? No way!

!Barry nods, enjoying Durand's reaction.

                DURAND
        (grinning)
    But why the ring?

                BARRY
        (mock sympathy)
    Dude, come-on. Use your brain. You know the saying.. "Deeper the connection, bigger the collection."

!Durand nods, but not fully understanding.

                BARRY
        (mock sympathy, with a theatrical flair)
    Imagine ... a young, handsome guy... his beautiful fiancée by his side. They're the epitome of love, destined for a perfect, fairy tale life together. They've got it all: success, admiration, dreams of starting a family. (dramatic pause) But then, tragically, he's faced with an impossible choice. How much is that relationship worth, you ask? (leans in, eyes wide with exaggerated emotion) It's ratings and drama that get the biggest payouts! (gestures dramatically) Picture the spectacle of a man torn between the purity of love and the allure of cold, hard cash! (dramatic music swells) If you set this up perfectly, and you'll be generating ratings through the roof! (leans back, gaze intense) And we all know what ratings mean, Durand... (voice trembling) Cash. Cold, hard cash.

!Realization creeps over Durand's face.

[[goal: cash in | id: scheme | subject: DURAND | object: SUZIE | for: rich | status: secret]]

                DURAND
    You're a freaking genius! Your ability to twist the most innocent ideas into brilliant masterpieces of deception is sheer dark artistry! You Rock!

!Barry and Durand hug; a good guy hug.

                BARRY
    Now. We need to pick someone sympathetic and totally in love with you. someone who'll make the audience really feel the weight of the decision.

