[[beat: Suzie's kindness gets to him | id: b23]]

                BARRY
    Susie?

!Upon hearing her name, Durand gets lost in thought.

                BARRY
    Dude!

                DURAND
    Let me tell you about Susie. Remember when mi Madre died?

!Barry nods.

                DURAND
    I tried to be the good, stoic soldier. Pretended to be strong like mi Madre.

                BARRY
    Single moms are super strong.

                DURAND
    I took care of everyone and everything. My brothers and sister were a mess, but I had to be the big brother - the rock of the family! There was no time to be sad. Too much to do. Someone had to take care of the store and Abuela. There were all of these people around, but Suzie was the only one who saw me. She'd just came over. Uninvited. She said "We don't have to talk or anything. But you need to just breathe." (Reflective pause - holding back tears) that's what mi Madre said when I was overwhelmed. Just breathe, mi cerro chiquito.

                BARRY
        (respectfully inquisitive)
    little mountain?

!Durand nods.

                BARRY
        (moved)
    Sounds like Suzie might be "the one."

                DURAND
