The game show set consists of a red outlined box on the floor and an electronic plexiglass screen behind the box.

ARCHIBALD is standing beside SUZIE.

[[beat: Suzie plays on and picks C | id: b28 | ahead: SUZIE]]

                ARCHIBALD
    We're back. Suzie has a Grand total of 21,224. Do you go on or just keep what you got?

                SUZIE
    I haven't worked this hard cashing in on my friends to give up now.

