[[beat: It is Nana | id: b29 | ahead: ARCHIBALD]]

[[goal: save | id: cure | subject: SUZIE | object: NANA]]

[[goal: cash in | id: payout | subject: NANA | object: SUZIE | status: secret]]

!NANA appears on the screen!

                SUZIE
        (visibly upset & confused)
    Nana!? I can't do this, Archibald. That's my Nana

                ARCHIBALD
    It's hard. I know. Tell me a little bit about your Nana.

                SUZIE
    Well. She raised me after my parents died. It wasn't easy. She never made a lot of money, but she would provide. And told me that someday, everyone would know my name. We would watch Moral Dilemma and argue who would be the best player.

!Suzie is lost in a sad thought.

                ARCHIBALD
    But there is more to this story, isn't there?

!Suzie nods reluctantly.

                ARCHIBALD
    Tell us.

                SUZIE
    About 10 years ago, Nana got sick. We were told that there is only one cure, but the treatments would cost about thirty-five thousand dollars.

                ARCHIBALD
    You have 21. Why not leave now? Use that money.

                SUZIE
    And then what? We can't raise 14 grand.

                ARCHIBALD
    If you would have only picked correctly on your boyfriend - Durand - you would have the money you need. Does Nana have a future?

!Suzie quivers.

[[beat: Suzie sells Nana | id: b31 | ahead: ARCHIBALD]]

                ARCHIBALD
    Let it not be said that Archibald Feinious Duke is a kind man. Your relationship with your nana is precious. You can walk away with the money and let her live out her few remaining weeks; maybe even months or earn an additional 325 thousand by letting your Nan be the next victim.

!A tear streams down Suzie's face, but she nods.

                ARCHIBALD
    I need a verbal answer.

                SUZIE
        (subdued)
    Yes.

[[status: abandoned | goal: cure]]

[[goal: cash in | id: sell-nana | subject: SUZIE | object: NANA | for: money | from: cure]]

                ARCHIBALD
    You know what I'm going to ask. 325,000 is a lot of money. Do we risk it for more?

                SUZIE
    That's more money than I have ever seen!

!Suzie seems lost in contemplative thought.

                ARCHIBALD
    Are you asking yourself, could Nana be the victim with the greatest payout in Game history.

!Suzie nods. Archibald waits. Suzie wipes her eyes and shows a determined face.

                SUZIE
    I'll do it.

                ARCHIBALD
    Thomas, show us Nana's video.

!INSERT - NANA VIDEO

                NANA
    The virus attacks the lungs making each day harder than the one before. There is nothing to look forward to but pain. But The Archibald told me. He said he could take the pain away and even get Suzie a little money if I agreed. I didn't hesitate.

                NARRATOR (O.S.)
    How would he do that?

                NANA
    He said the show could get a shot. A beautiful white liquid that would remove the pain long enough for me to say my goodbyes and then fall asleep painless for the first time in ten years. He is so kind. Thank you, Archibald!

!BACK TO SCENE

[[beat: The million-dollar offer and its catch | id: b34 | ahead: ARCHIBALD]]

                ARCHIBALD
    I'm afraid her desire to end it really lowered the value of the relationship. It is now worth 50,000.

                SUZIE
    No!. Nana.

                ARCHIBALD
    Your grandmother's story is compelling. You decided her fate and the entire 72,224 dollars is all yours. You can keep it, or you can have the largest payout in show history.

                SUZIE
    The largest?

                ARCHIBALD
    One million dollars.

                SUZIE
        (disbelief)
    A million dollars?

