                SUZIE
    What else. I know that there has to be something else. Archibald Duke always has an "AND." What is it?

                ARCHIBALD
        (impressed)
    AND You would have to watch her suffer. We will give you the ability to stop her suffering at any time, but for up to five days, you will earn 200,000 dollars for each day of her suffering.

